# The Cloud's image is built with the repository as its context
# (cloud/docker-compose.yml): only these seven paths go in. No evidence file,
# fixture, run folder or .env can reach the image, and no bytecode of the
# build machine: the image compiles the source it was given (the last line,
# after the seven, since the last match wins).
*
!cloud/pyproject.toml
!cloud/uv.lock
!cloud/alembic.ini
!cloud/app
!shared/schemas
!shared/tools
!shared/tsa
**/__pycache__
